<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/wolfram2002-ch04-26> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasAssessment> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok--analysis-feasibility>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok--data-adequacy>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok--data-existence>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok--discriminating-power>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-26--grok--operationalizability>
